{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國天團防彈少年團（BTS）在高雄世運主場館的3場演出昨晚圓滿落幕，7子不僅國語向台迷問好外，V又用台語大讚粉絲「真的是最讚」，J-Hope承諾不管是高雄還是台北，都會再回來一次，多次大讚高雄美食好吃的Jungkook亦直接說出「我不想走」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T03:28:59.524007+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T03:17:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T03:22:23.515643+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T03:22:23.515643+00:00","content_hash":"7fde907ad7c54eb015391bc909c3a7c4099ae5122a9c4c773d29ad7450f34f20","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}